# --- Phase 0/4 reconstruction: unsanitized personal health data (ADR-7) ---
# Only a sanitized derivative ever ships in the public repo. The payload table carries the
# same class of data as the reconstruction itself (lab values, doses, clinic names), so it
# stays local for the same reason -- see docs/engineering/replay-architecture.md 4.1.
docs/evidence/timeline-entries.md
docs/evidence/replay_payloads.json

# Generated replay datasets (derived from the two files above; regenerable via cli.convert)
data/replay/
